Plan steps B1-B5 of COMPLETE_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md, written offline 2026-08-20:
- include/ocudu/kaiair/pktr_neighbor_store.h: process-wide signal-map feed, CU-CP
  publishes each UE's serving+neighbor SSB-RSRP (38.133 idx-156 dBm) keyed by C-RNTI
  (dissertation §4.5.5: the UE only measures, K is computed gNB-side); peer cells'
  per-link state (K, TX pwr, beta, ER, signal, rx-power-from-us) ingested from the
  agent's peer-bus snapshot file at ~2 Hz
- lib/cu_cp/cell_meas_manager_impl.cpp: MeasurementReport hook -> store
- pktr_conflict_graph.h: PRK ER membership + mutual conflict relation (PRKS §III-D)
- pktr_slot_gate.h: ONAMA deterministic per-(slot,link) priorities, masks, fail-open
- pktr_gate_table.h: atomic snapshot the slot path reads (observe | enforce)
- pktr_er_controller.h: per-tick live K/ER per UE from measured neighbors (signal =
  serving RSRP, candidates = neighbor RSRPs, E_max = S - gamma_DL - sigma_DL*k), peer
  links, conflict sets, masks -> gate table
- intra_slice_scheduler can_allocate_pdsch: gate lookup (KAIAIR_PKTR_ER_GATE)
- metrics view: runs the tick, emits links[] (what the peer bus forwards), gate counters
- env: KAIAIR_PKTR_PEERS_FILE, KAIAIR_PKTR_ER_GATE, KAIAIR_PKTR_SSB_DBM
- unit tests: neighbor store, conflict graph, slot gate (gtest, to run on the bench)
UL-victim attribution, er_gate live overlay and the background executor are follow-ups.
